        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Cost</strong> nothing · <strong>Requirements</strong> You are in <strong>Severance</strong></p><hr /><p><em>Blue Wave.</em> Reiryoku gathers in the hollow of the blade and leaves it as a single wave.</p><p><strong>60-foot line</strong>, basic Reflex, <strong>slashing</strong> damage.</p><p>Creatures that fail are pushed <strong>30 feet</strong> directly away from you and knocked <strong>prone</strong>. Creatures that critically fail are pushed <strong>60 feet</strong> instead.</p><hr /><p><strong>Waning.</strong> The damage is <strong>20d6</strong> if used in the first round of Severance, and two dice fewer each round after &mdash; 18d6, 16d6, 14d6, 12d6, 10d6, and <strong>8d6</strong> in the seventh. After the seventh round this cannot be used at all.</p><p><strong>Using this ends Severance</strong>, whether you want it to or not.</p>"
